== 7.9 Chapter 7 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [A scale of 1 : 50 000 means that 1 cm on the map represents],
  [500 m],
  [5 km],
  [50 m],
  [50 km]
)

#mcq(2, [A scale of 1 : 25 000 means that 1 cm represents],
  [250 m],
  [2.5 km],
  [25 m],
  [25 km]
)

#mcq(3, [A scale of 1 : 100 000 means that 1 cm represents],
  [100 m],
  [100 km],
  [10 km],
  [1 km]
)

#mcq(4, [The scale written as '1 cm represents 0.5 km' is a],
  [bar scale],
  [statement scale],
  [linear scale],
  [representative fraction]
)

#mcq(5, [A linear scale is useful because it],
  [does not change when a map is enlarged or reduced],
  [shows bearings],
  [gives grid references],
  [shows the height of land]
